usage: full_candidate_ordinary_rehearsal.py [-h] --output OUTPUT --inventory
                                            INVENTORY --inventory-sha256
                                            INVENTORY_SHA256

All current application migrations under ordinary local installer authority.
Creates only task-owned networkless containers. A privileged setup installs
the retained Auth/storage platform shape, pg_cron and pg_net before postgres
is demoted. Every application migration then executes as current_user postgres
NOSUPERUSER. This proves local installer behavior; managed hosted platform
parity is separate.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --inventory INVENTORY
  --inventory-sha256 INVENTORY_SHA256
